@startuml diff-viewer-enhancements-class
title Diff data model (ide-core) after intraline spans

class FileDiff {
  old_path: Option<PathBuf>
  new_path: Option<PathBuf>
  hunks: Vec<DiffHunk>
  truncated: bool
}

class DiffHunk {
  old_start: u32
  new_start: u32
  lines: Vec<DiffLine>
}

enum DiffLine {
  Context(String)
  Added(String, Vec<DiffSpan>)
  Removed(String, Vec<DiffSpan>)
}

class DiffSpan {
  start: usize
  end: usize
}

FileDiff "1" *-- "0..*" DiffHunk
DiffHunk "1" *-- "0..*" DiffLine
DiffLine "1" *-- "0..*" DiffSpan : Added/Removed only

note right of DiffSpan
  Byte offsets into that
  DiffLine's own text,
  char-boundary-aligned.
  Empty Vec = unpaired
  (pure insert/delete) or
  identical after trim.
end note

note bottom of DiffLine
  intraline_diff() populates
  spans by pairing consecutive
  Removed-run with following
  Added-run, index-wise (§3.1).
end note

@enduml
